config OXP_WMI
	tristate "OneXPlayer OxpWMI EC (Intel)"
	depends on ACPI_WMI
	depends on HWMON
	depends on DMI
	help
	  WMI client for OneXPlayer Intel handhelds that use
	  SuRwECRegInterface (ecAccessType=2 / OxpWMI).

	  Calls ACPI method WMAC with Integer Arg2 (same as Windows CIM
	  ReadECReg/WriteECReg). Falls back to wmidev Buffer Arg2 only if
	  WMAC is missing. Exposes fan/PWM/CPU temp via hwmon and charge
	  limit / bypass via sysfs.

	  Do not enable this on AMD / WinRing0 boards (oxpec).

	  If unsure, say N.
